<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the German</p>
<p>first division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>17 - Bernhard Winkler (1860 Munich), Fredi Bobic (VfB</p>
<p>Stuttgart)</p>
<p>15 - Giovane Elber (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>14 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen), Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe)</p>
<p>13 - Ulf Kirsten, Paulo Sergio (both Bayer</p>
<p>Leverkusen)</p>
<p>12 - Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa Rostock)</p>
<p>11 - Toni Polster (Cologne), Juergen Klinsmann</p>
<p>(Bayern Munich), Martin Max (Schalke)</p>
<p>10 - Stephane Chapuisat (Borussia Dortmund), Krassimir</p>
<p>Balakov (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
</text>
